OCPARTICLE 2
NAME Rain 100k
# Wave 10 demo: 100,000 live particles on the GPU. 50,000 drops a second, each living two seconds, stretched along their
# velocity. Wind is a user parameter a script can set (Particles.SetVector). No sorting: thin alpha-blended streaks do not need it.
PARAM Wind vec3 0 0 0
EMITTER Rain
SIM gpu
SHAPE box 3000 3000 10
BLEND alphablend
EMISSION 50000 0 100000
LIFETIME 2 2
DIRECTION 0 0 -1 1.5
SPEED 850 1000
GRAVITY 0 0 0
DAMPING 0
SIZE 1.4 1.4
COLOR start 0.75 0.82 0.95 0.35
COLOR end 0.75 0.82 0.95 0.25
SPRITE velocity stretch 0.9
SORT none
LIGHTING ambient
FOG on
GI on
BOUNDS 4500
CULL 12000
MODULE update.force x=@Wind.x y=@Wind.y z=@Wind.z
